        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, crude oil pipeline, offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, crude oil pipeline, offshore
Calculation for energy use. There are differences depending on diameter and difference of height.;
UUID: 3b5d0e0e-1faa-34c9-877c-7cc151076ef8
Energy use for pumping and emissions of oil due to accidents.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Operation of crude oil pipelines by diesel-electric generating set.
Time period: Old publications for energy use. New study for oil losses.
Production volume: 79 miam3 tkm of transported crude oil in RER in 2015.
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: From single data to global situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b5d0e0e-1faa-34c9-877c-7cc151076ef8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
